sion of Dark Trip. Because the game contains mature content, the review takes longer than usual, but in the meantime you can already play the Playtest!The Playtest has been updated with the newest build, the same version you will find in the public Demo once it's released. To join, just click \"Request Access\" in the Playtest section on the Dark Trip store page.If you try it, we'd love to hear what you think. Your feedback in the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T15:17:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656396791","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3492640-1840310314355101","game_id":"steam-3492640","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest Updates","summary":"A Big Thank You to Our PlaytestersWe've just pushed another round of updates to the playtest build, and we wanted to take a moment to thank everyone who's been playing, testing, and sending us feedback. Your input has been invaluable.Over the past several builds, we've been steadily improving the experience: refining inventory management and controls, polishing pickup and interaction animations, smoothing out the UI and HUD, and squashing a number of bugs along the way. Each update has brought t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-11T20:51:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314355101","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3492640-1836506165570080","game_id":"steam-3492640","kind":"update","title":"Dark Trip Playtest Update","summary":"Hello investigators!Over the past few weeks, we have released several updates for the Dark Trip Playtest. All of these improvements are now included in the latest version. The biggest change is a complete redesign of the inspection system. You can now freely rotate collected items, zoom in, examine details, and switch between clues more smoothly. We also added new animations and events for discovering and inspecting evidence. Other improvements include:* More intuitive ESC key behavior in the in","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-03T10:18:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165570080","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3492640-1834602721187840","game_id":"steam-3492640","kind":"announcement","title":"Dark Trip Playtest Sign-Up","summary":"Hello everyone!We’re opening the very first playtest of Dark Trip on Steam. This is still an early version of the game, and your feedback will help us understand what works, what feels unclear, and what needs more polish. In Dark Trip, you take on the role of an investigator searching for a missing woman. You’ll explore creepy rooms, see strange things, take pills to solve puzzles, rely on hallucinations to investigate an eerie crime, and perform wicked experiments inside a mysterious laboratory","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-04T15:10:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721187840","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3492640":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:41:06Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:41:06Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3492640":"2026-10-26T00:41:06Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3492640":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:41:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:41:06Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4754360":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10